<title>USA: Big Foot,Fairfield Savings FY ends June 30.</title>
<headline>Big Foot,Fairfield Savings FY ends June 30.</headline>
<dateline>LONG GROVE, Ill. 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Big Foot Financial Corp, holding company for Fairfield Savings Bank FSB, said Tuesday the fiscal year for both the company and the bank will end on June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>Previously, the company's fiscal year ended July 31.</p>
<p>Earlier Tuesday, Big Foot, which went public on December 19, reported earnings for the January 31 second quarter rose to $226,000 from $21,000.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
